  "review_notes": [
    "Two waw-plus-negative fusions (neither, nor) are read under rule 35 and headed on the negative; the ASV writes no separate not in either clause, so nothing is left for the particle on its own.",
    "s019 is MACULA's object marker but the ASV spends are with on the relation, so rule 16's family plus rule 49's copula placement give it are with, headed on with.",
    "The ASV reverses the pair briers/thorns relative to the Hebrew nouns; each noun takes the English word standing in its slot in the ASV's order."
